WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
More agents create more handoffs. Coordinate specialized agents without losing context or ownership.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Give each role one bounded job.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Define evidence contracts between agents.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Preserve context across transfers.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Own coordination failures.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Design the team, not just agents.
